{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28545","headline":"留诲曹师等诗 · 杜牧","name":"留诲曹师等诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万物有丑好，各一姿状分。\n唯人即不尔，学与不学论。\n学非探其花，要自拨其根。\n孝友与诚实，而不忘尔言。\n根本既深实，柯叶自滋繁。\n念尔无忽此，期以庆吾门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}